    "catalogue_description": "This map features UGX Mod v1.0.3! Description: Zombie infested graveyard. Dark and mysterious tombs. thousands of undead monsters. Choose to fight or die and escape from The Tomb!\u201d Features: UGX MOD Kino style box light indicators. Unique Design. Skeleton Crew Zombies \u2013 the bad guys from karate kid lol. Cool Loading Screen. Graveyard and Mausoleum. Gun Game, Sharpshooter etc 4 Perk Pumps. Small Easter Egg to unlock PAP. UGX Easy Fx. And More. Credits. Treminaor and UGX Team (UGX MOD) ZK (Tutorials) YaPh1l (Box Location Indicator & Typewriter Intro Text) Tom-BMX (End Game) If I have forgotten to credit you \u2013 please message me and I will add you right away, my apologies.",
